{0 corvus-json-schema}

A JSON Schema evaluator for draft 4, 6, 7, 2019-09 and 2020-12, with no dependencies outside the OCaml distribution.
A schema is compiled once into fail-fast plans, and any number of instances are then validated against it, as JSON text
or as parsed documents.

{1 The library}

The package has one library for programs, [corvus-json-schema], with one module:

- {!Corvus_json_schema}: documents, options, validators, results and annotations.

{1 Internal libraries}

The package is built from two more libraries. They are installed with it, and they are not a supported interface:
either can change in any release.

- {!Corvus_json_schema_ecmaregex} ([corvus-json-schema.ecmaregex]): the ECMA-262 regular expression engine behind
  [pattern], [patternProperties] and the [regex] format.
- {!Corvus_json_schema_ucd} ([corvus-json-schema.ucd]): the Unicode data the engine and the formats read.
